{
    "title": "iCut: Video Editor & Maker",
    "description": "iCut--A Video Editor & maker provides powerful video editing features, allowing you to create stunning videos effortlessly. \r\n\r\niCut is an all-in-one editing tool for both video and photo. iCut allows you to cut, crop, rotate, merge, split, and add transitions, filters, stickers, texts, music, voice extraction, and more. With iCut, you can easily merge multiple clips, add video effects, and adjust video speed. Additionally, you can fine-tune the brightness, contrast, saturation, speed, volume, and other parameters of your videos and photos. iCut enables you to export your videos in various formats and resolutions, and share them on social media platforms like YouTube, Instagram, and TikTok.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n--Video Editing\r\n\u2022Split/Trim video. \r\n\u2022Cut Video: Precisely cut video clips as desired. Simply drag the timeline to remove the unwanted segments.\r\n\u2022Merge Videos: Combine multiple clips into a seamless, high-quality video. \r\n\u2022Adjust Video Ratio: Fit your video and photo in any aspect ratio for Youtube, TikTok, Instagram, and whatsapp.\r\n\u2022Speed: Video Speed up/ slow. Make slow motion and make the video speed more smooth.\r\n\u2022Add Custom Watermark: Protect your work with personalized watermarks. Essential for any video maker and movie maker.\r\n\u2022Custom Backgrounds: Easily remove background\r\n\r\n--Advanced Movie Maker\r\n\u2022Picture-in-Picture(PIP):\u00a0Overlay a smaller video or image on top of a larger one. Adjust size, position, and opacity for dynamic effects.\r\n\u2022Keyframe: Make video pro: video camera movement, sticker movement, subtitle scrolling, closing effects, etc.\r\n\u2022Reverse: Play the video backwards. Can choose to reverse one clip or the whole video.\r\n\u2022Mask:\u00a0Hide or reveal parts of the video. You can choose from different shapes, such as circle, square, star, etc, and adjust the size, position, and feather of the mask. You can also animate the mask with keyframes.\r\n\u2022Video Template: Import your local videos into iCut, and then quickly generate to hot style videos.\r\n\r\n--Music&Voice-over\r\n\u2022Add sound effect to your video.\r\n\u2022Extract audio from video.\r\n\u2022Music-synced video\r\n\u2022Video Dubbing and voice-over in iCut.\r\n\u2022Adjust volume and make the music fade in /out.\r\n\r\n--Sticker&Text\r\n\u2022Multiple and all kinds of stickers and text fonts are available.Add fun and cute elements to your video, such as emojis, animals, flowers, or birthdays stickers.\r\n\u2022Add styles and animations to the subtitle text of your vlog.\r\n\u2022adjust the text animation with key frame.\r\nFilters&Effects\r\n\u2022Change the color, tone, mood, or style of your video, use the preset filters such as black and white, sepia, vintage, or cartoon.or customize your own filter settings.\r\n\u2022Add some magic or drama to your video, such as fire,, snow, or glitch. You can choose from different types of effects and adjust their duration.\r\n\r\niCut is a useful and easy-to-use video editor which has various of video template to use and makes the video editing become fast, and reliable.A powerful video editing tool for video creator and collage maker.\r\n\r\nContact us:\r\nIf you have any questions and advise about iCut\uff08quick free video editor, film maker, collage maker\uff09,please feel free to contact us through the email address:team@icutservice.com.\r\n\r\nMore video information and tutorial videos can follow our instagram account:\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/icut_editor/",
    "descriptionHTML": "iCut--A Video Editor &amp; maker provides powerful video editing features, allowing you to create stunning videos effortlessly. <br><br>iCut is an all-in-one editing tool for both video and photo. iCut allows you to cut, crop, rotate, merge, split, and add transitions, filters, stickers, texts, music, voice extraction, and more. With iCut, you can easily merge multiple clips, add video effects, and adjust video speed. Additionally, you can fine-tune the brightness, contrast, saturation, speed, volume, and other parameters of your videos and photos. iCut enables you to export your videos in various formats and resolutions, and share them on social media platforms like YouTube, Instagram, and TikTok.<br><br>Features:<br>--Video Editing<br>\u2022Split/Trim video. <br>\u2022Cut Video: Precisely cut video clips as desired. Simply drag the timeline to remove the unwanted segments.<br>\u2022Merge Videos: Combine multiple clips into a seamless, high-quality video. <br>\u2022Adjust Video Ratio: Fit your video and photo in any aspect ratio for Youtube, TikTok, Instagram, and whatsapp.<br>\u2022Speed: Video Speed up/ slow. Make slow motion and make the video speed more smooth.<br>\u2022Add Custom Watermark: Protect your work with personalized watermarks. Essential for any video maker and movie maker.<br>\u2022Custom Backgrounds: Easily remove background<br><br>--Advanced Movie Maker<br>\u2022Picture-in-Picture(PIP):\u00a0Overlay a smaller video or image on top of a larger one. Adjust size, position, and opacity for dynamic effects.<br>\u2022Keyframe: Make video pro: video camera movement, sticker movement, subtitle scrolling, closing effects, etc.<br>\u2022Reverse: Play the video backwards. Can choose to reverse one clip or the whole video.<br>\u2022Mask:\u00a0Hide or reveal parts of the video. You can choose from different shapes, such as circle, square, star, etc, and adjust the size, position, and feather of the mask. You can also animate the mask with keyframes.<br>\u2022Video Template: Import your local videos into iCut, and then quickly generate to hot style videos.<br><br>--Music&amp;Voice-over<br>\u2022Add sound effect to your video.<br>\u2022Extract audio from video.<br>\u2022Music-synced video<br>\u2022Video Dubbing and voice-over in iCut.<br>\u2022Adjust volume and make the music fade in /out.<br><br>--Sticker&amp;Text<br>\u2022Multiple and all kinds of stickers and text fonts are available.Add fun and cute elements to your video, such as emojis, animals, flowers, or birthdays stickers.<br>\u2022Add styles and animations to the subtitle text of your vlog.<br>\u2022adjust the text animation with key frame.<br>Filters&amp;Effects<br>\u2022Change the color, tone, mood, or style of your video, use the preset filters such as black and white, sepia, vintage, or cartoon.or customize your own filter settings.<br>\u2022Add some magic or drama to your video, such as fire,, snow, or glitch. You can choose from different types of effects and adjust their duration.<br><br>iCut is a useful and easy-to-use video editor which has various of video template to use and makes the video editing become fast, and reliable.A powerful video editing tool for video creator and collage maker.<br><br>Contact us:<br>If you have any questions and advise about iCut\uff08quick free video editor, film maker, collage maker\uff09,please feel free to contact us through the email address:team@icutservice.com.<br><br>More video information and tutorial videos can follow our instagram account:<br>https://www.instagram.com/icut_editor/",
